sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Usuario (Browser)
    participant W as betmexico-web (FastAPI)
    participant D as deposits.py
    participant P as ProcessorPay<br/>(gateway banco)
    participant DB as BD SQLite

    U->>W: POST /api/deposits/execute-stream<br/>{account_id, card_pipe, amount}
    W->>D: execute_stream() SSE
    D->>D: _check_caps(email, amount)
    D->>D: _parse_pipe(card_pipe)
    D->>D: _run_deposit_with_phases(...)
    D->>D: gentle_login (proxy pool, captcha v2)
    D-->>U: SSE phase: login_start / login_done
    D->>P: BeginDeposit (jwt, amount)
    D-->>U: SSE phase: begin_done
    D->>P: makePayment(jwt, card)
    P-->>D: BANK_APPROVED / BANK_REJECTED / 3DS
    D-->>U: SSE phase: submit_done
    alt approved
        D->>P: verify bankTransaction
        D->>DB: account_cards INSERT<br/>(register_card_to_account, idempotent)
    end
    D->>DB: deposit_attempts INSERT<br/>(_record_attempt: card_pipe, status)
    D-->>U: SSE phase: check_done / done
    D->>W: _broadcast SSE<br/>{type:activity, kind:deposit, card_pipe, ...}
    Note over W,U: SSE stream de fases (stepper UI)<br/>+ SSE actividad via /api/events
